      "detailed_description": "<strong>Dungeon 100</strong> is a roguelite that combines the deep theory-crafting and player choice of classic ARPGs like Diablo and Path of Exile with autobattler gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>ARPG Experience Without the Grind</strong> - No equipment and gear to spend countless hours grinding for. Instead freely choose from hundreds of cards to combine them in interesting ways for diverse character build possibilities.<br></li><li> <strong>Unlimited Character Customization</strong> - Create unique skills by combining different effects of the hundreds of available cards. Transform into a bear that spits out dozens of flaming arrows a second, or summon hounds that can summon even more hounds, or play as a spin-to-win warrior! <br></li><li> <strong>Become the Dungeon Boss</strong> - Every 15 floors of the dungeon, there will be a dragon. Slay the dragon and you will become the Boss of that floor. You must then defeat your past characters to progress further into the dungeon.</li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<strong>Dungeon 100</strong> is a roguelite that combines the deep theory-crafting and player choice of classic ARPGs like Diablo and Path of Exile with autobattler gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>ARPG Experience Without the Grind</strong> - No equipment and gear to spend countless hours grinding for. Instead freely choose from hundreds of cards to combine them in interesting ways for diverse character build possibilities.<br></li><li> <strong>Unlimited Character Customization</strong> - Create unique skills by combining different effects of the hundreds of available cards. Transform into a bear that spits out dozens of flaming arrows a second, or summon hounds that can summon even more hounds, or play as a spin-to-win warrior! <br></li><li> <strong>Become the Dungeon Boss</strong> - Every 15 floors of the dungeon, there will be a dragon. Slay the dragon and you will become the Boss of that floor. You must then defeat your past characters to progress further into the dungeon.</li></ul>",
      "short_description": "The dragon-slayer becomes the dragon. Create unique builds without having to grind for equipment. After defeating a dungeon boss, you will take its place. Then, defeat your past selves to descend further into the dungeon.",
